- **Gate A — PASS.** The actual translated program is identical to the macro
  used by the proof. Both body variants prove under the fixed semantics, and
  the loop bridge proves in a module that excludes that bridge. Complete state
  and control contexts are matched. Total equations have disjoint coverage and
